╭─ Issue description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Issue Title: feat(middleware): add a budget middleware to control the total token usage                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ **Background**                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ In scheduled tasks, users may not be present to monitor agent execution. To prevent agents from running indefinitely, it is necessary to        │
│ enforce a maximum token budget. Once the budget is reached, a hint message should be injected before the next reasoning step, prompting the     │
│ agent to exit the ReAct loop and produce a concluding response (i.e., without invoking any tools).                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ In AgentScope 2.0, this can be elegantly handled via middleware. Since the `Msg` class already tracks token usage statistics, we only need to   │
│ accumulate the token consumption of the current reply before each reasoning step. When the usage exceeds the predefined token budget, a hint    │
│ message is injected prior to reasoning, instructing the agent to wrap up immediately.                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ **Changes**                                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
